~ start
Wend WovenWay: This way, StoryWeaver!
Wend WovenWay: Oh... It looks like the Void took out the bridge after I crossed.
Wend WovenWay: Take that ball of yarn!
Wend WovenWay: With it, you can hook pins and needles to grapple across the water and the Void.
Wend WovenWay: I'll wait for you here!
=> END

~ interact
Wend WovenWay: You made it!
if all_buttons_collected():
	Wend WovenWay: And it looks like you picked up all the buttons. Very thorough!
else:
	Wend WovenWay: You missed a few buttons, though. No problem!
Wend WovenWay: Pick up the thread, and we can move on to Fray's End.
=> END

~ thread_collected
Wend WovenWay: At last! We'll be at Fray's End in no time.
Wend WovenWay: Take the threads you've collected to the Eternal Loom when you get there.
Wend WovenWay: It's huge. You can't miss it.
=> END
